<title>USA: Hartland CS, Mich., won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Hartland CS, Mich., won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth said it won $19.475 million of Hartland Consolidated Schools, Mich., 1996 general obligation school building and site bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.37 percent.</p>
</text>
